    "success_criteria": {
      "criteria": [
        "When estimate/v2 decides predicted from the cohort-matched population, lane estimate exits 0 and writes a revision carrying that v2 decision even when the whole-population v1 run would raise ReferenceTableRequiredError; no --reference-* flags are needed. A regression test with 8 cohort-eligible observations plus nearer cohort-less ineligible ones fails on 048715d and passes after the change.",
        "When v2 abstains and no reference table is given, behavior is unchanged (abstained revision, same reason codes); when a reference table is given, the v1 reference_table path is unchanged.",
        "Observations whose intent_id equals the estimated intent are excluded from both the v1 and v2 populations, asserted by a test where the target's own observation would otherwise be the nearest neighbor (distance 0).",
        "The persisted v2 decision (or the revision) lets an operator trace a v2 prediction to the record_ids of the observations it used, without a breaking change to the vendored estimate/v2 contract; if the contract cannot carry it compatibly, Phase 2 records that and moves this criterion to a follow-up intent instead of changing the contract.",
        "All packages/* test suites, typecheck and biome stay green; CHANGELOG has an Unreleased entry."
      ],
      "recorded_at": "2026-11-13T11:21:17.553Z"
    }
  }
